  "exec_summary": "The European Banking Authority has issued an EBA email alert on 24 July 2026, although details of the alert are not specified. In Belgium and the EU, the Markets in Crypto-Assets regulation, or MiCA, has seen its first license granted, with Unlimit securing authorization to expand digital-asset services across the European Union. The MiCA framework is expected to have significant implications for crypto-asset service providers, with some reports suggesting that smaller exchanges may be impacted. The National Bank of Belgium and the European Commission will likely play a key role in overseeing the implementation of MiCA in Belgium.",
